    <briefdescription>
<para>Turbulent dissipation rate wall function BC. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Mirrors Foam::epsilonWallFunctionFvPatchScalarField: blends viscous and log-layer ε estimates (BINOMIAL n=2) and sets the wall face value.</para>
<para>Required BoundaryContext fields:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>&quot;k&quot;</computeroutput> VolumeField&lt;scalar&gt; — turbulent kinetic energy</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>&quot;nu&quot;</computeroutput> VolumeField&lt;scalar&gt; — laminar viscosity, boundary values</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>&quot;nearWallDist&quot;</computeroutput> VolumeField&lt;scalar&gt; — cell-to-wall distance y, boundary values</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Single-patch-corner only (cornerWeights == 1). G feedback is handled by the parent KEpsilon model, not by this BC. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
